s10-4-p7 : Block
s10-4-p7 = prose (cons "This gives a precise account of information as constraints on possible states and actions. Given a value function on admissible trajectories, one can compare the optimum over trajectories compatible with one observation to the optimum over a refined observation. Monotonicity follows when refinement expands the available *contingent policies* and the objective and feasibility assumptions are held fixed; it does not follow from arbitrary differences of observations alone." nil)
